Having just tried this yesterday; Don't offer a unicorn of the same
alignment as the altar currently is. I tried offering a black unicorn
to a chaotic altar (I was neutral), and it wouldn't take the corpse.
I seem to recall I got zapped for my pains. Above all, don't offer
a unicorn of your own alignment to an altar.

The priest will not convert with the altar. I believe he gets pissed
at you when you convert the altar. But if you attack him before
converting the altar, his god will help him fight you, which can be
a real shocker.
